<title>USA: Intl CableTel sues Groupe Videotron.</title>
<headline>Intl CableTel sues Groupe Videotron.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>International CableTel Inc said on Thursday that it has filed a multiple count lawsuit in the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York against Groupe Videotron Ltee and one of its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>The company said that the lawsuit stems from Groupe's sale to Bell CableMedia Plc of its interest in Videotron Plc, a British based telephony and cable company.</p>
<p>In the lawsuit, CableTel is seeking damages in connection with Groupe's failure to negotiate exclusively with CableTel in the sale of Groupe's interest in Videotron Plc, after having agreed to do so.</p>
